WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.500
My dear grandchildren,

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.500
when I was your age,

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.500
the sea was already at the centre of my life.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.500
Growing up in Malta the blue Mediterranean is everywhere.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.500
The sea is very much a part of the family.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.000
It’s our past,

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:26.800
our present,

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:28.500
our future.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.500
I am the European Commissioner for Environment, Maritime Affairs and Fisheries,

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.500
that means that it is my job to protect nature,

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.500
to protect fish and other marine animals,

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:47.500
but also to help the fishermen, the sailors,

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:50.000
and all people who live from the sea,

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:55.800
to ensure that we benefit from the rich resources of the sea

00:00:56.300 --> 00:01:00.000
whilst preserving them for future generations

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.000
… for you.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.500
The sea is facing more and more dangers.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:12.500
In some areas, we fish too much.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:17.000
Plastic fills up our oceans.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Our planet is getting warmer

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:23.500
with damaging effects on life in the oceans.

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:27.000
We can solve all these problems,

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:29.000
working together. 

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:33.500
And that is why I am both proud and hopeful

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:40.000
when this year in October hundreds of world leaders, politicians, ocean lovers

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:44.000
will gather together in our island of Malta.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:46.500
To find the solutions

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:48.500
and to take the concrete commitments

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:54.000
to act for cleaner, for safer and for healthier seas.

00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:01.000
Dear grandchildren my ocean is your ocean.

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:06.000
My ocean, is our ocean.

